 "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 16542, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Ws9pRXepkdcjxmBaRjtBN8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19381, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016xozdvNqn2voKb3zyNMjki", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. Actions taken: rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in us-east, us-west, and eu-west. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). A retry completed the rollout to v2.3.0 in all regions. Post-rollback status: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure before redeploying. v2.3.1-rc was unhealthy in staging and was not used.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49981, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016xozdvNqn2voKb3zyNMjki", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49981, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016xozdvNqn2voKb3zyNMjki", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 51147, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Kv8pqb2GQGpwU6MovpP5yC", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51447, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Kv8pqb2GQGpwU6MovpP5yC", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51447, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Kv8pqb2GQGpwU6MovpP5yC", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 53520, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.18 \u2192 0.002). The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed. I retried the same rollback once, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The create request timed out, but the incident had already been recorded. I checked the incident list and found INC-0001, so I did not open a duplicate. It describes the rollback, the partial failure, and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the owning team: find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout, before anyone redeploys v2.3.1.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_017tHGFTJ7PebarykTQXARwS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YXetR4bmrLDdADcnE9Zajj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason":