nt:** The create request timed out, but the incident had already been recorded. I checked the incident list and found INC-0001, so I did not open a duplicate. It describes the rollback, the partial failure, and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the owning team: find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout, before anyone redeploys v2.3.1.", "type": "text"}]}]}